>> +
>> +	/*
>> +	 * RMPOPT (F2 0F 01 FC): RAX = 1GB-aligned SPA, RCX = op type, CF set if
>> +	 * the range was optimized (result unused on this path).
>> +	 *
>> +	 * Binutils does not support the RMPOPT mnemonic yet, so the instruction
>> +	 * is encoded with .byte.
